id: pm-vkckiv
title: Patch qs 6.16.0 after independent OSV detection of GHSA-6pq8-jhm2-2vcw
description: "The complete independent OSV gate on October27 reports GHSA-6pq8-jhm2-2vcw for locked qs6.16.0 while npm audit still reports zero. GitHub advisory https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-6pq8-jhm2-2vcw, updated October27, identifies6.16.1 as patched. The installed edge is development-only Stryker10 -> typed-rest-client2.3.1 -> qs6.16.0. Six library-level comma serializer triggers throw and two ordinary controls pass. Application-level production exploitability is not established. Preserve the completed older qs6.16.0 remediation under pm-mlpn91 for its distinct advisories."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
