acceptance_criteria: "Every locked qs edge resolves to6.16.1 or later within major6; Six original and alternate comma serializer triggers no longer throw and ordinary serialization controls remain unchanged; Independent all-package OSV and npm evidence both report zero without advisory suppression; Existing strict quality, runtime distribution and frozen-lockfile contracts pass"
