risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: "All locked qs bindings resolve to mature6.16.1 or a later verified safe major6 release, the original and alternate comma serialization triggers no longer throw, ordinary controls retain their contract, and complete independent dependency evidence reports zero without suppressions."
