comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-27T16:39:18.304Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete3141-item all-status corpus has no matching advisory. Fresh advisory-ID and qs searches plus live open and in_progress lists were read. Full live older qs owner data/history confirms completed different advisories, and the security capability parent data/history was refreshed. This is a newly updated advisory and a distinct bounded repair, not a reopening of completed work."
  "2026-10-27T16:42:57.591Z","harness:codex","Independent pre-patch package proof: all6 JSON, parsed-prototype and null-prototype comma serialization cases throw TypeError in6.16.0, while2 ordinary controls pass. Patched6.16.1 passes those6 cases,8 alternate nested/parsed/encoding cases and the actual typed-rest-client Util.getUrl route. Ordinary repeat/comma/scalar serialization remains identical and intentional custom-encoder failures still propagate. The direct consumer harness initially needed its pnpm symlink resolved physically; corrected setup passes. Both parent investigation and an independent read-only investigation trace only the development Stryker->typed-rest-client edge, absent from runtime distribution, with production exploitability unproven. Raised the existing major6 override floor to6.16.1 and regenerated only its resolution, using an explicitly verified10080-minute resolver age.6.16.1 was published October14; today6.17.0 was deliberately not adopted. Frozen install, runtime lock, complete567-package OSV and npm evidence now pass. Fresh candidate review and full quality gates remain pending."
  "2026-10-27T16:47:17.266Z","harness:codex","Fresh candidate review found no concrete surviving vulnerable binding or compatibility regression. It independently exercised28 malicious representations,7 ordinary controls and169 unchanged comparative outputs; the one ISO-8859-1 plus-sign difference matches the documented upstream correctness fix and round-trips. The unchanged independent gate was also replayed on immutable b76d697ee source in a disposable checkout: complete feed receipts identify the exact qs6.16.0 advisory and the gate refuses with native exit1; setup or unavailable-feed conditions cannot count as proof. Current567-package receipts are clear. Full repository acceptance and delivery review remain pending."
  "2026-10-27T17:44:24.576Z","harness:codex","Validation: qualified Node24 canonical coverage completed in 1157.23 seconds: 878 files passed plus one platform skip; 11512 tests passed and 3 platform skips; statements71117/71117, branches54752/54752, functions14628/14628, lines67266/67266, exact100% with zero uncovered. Fresh linked test receipts passed for each active owner. Packed out-of-tree npm and Bun consumers pass typed refusals, custom statuses and portable scope. Typecheck, ESLint, generated contracts/surface, 10 SDK import costs, 567-package advisory gate, runtime closure42, graph9/9, record integrity1/1, bounded mutation345 killed+7 equivalent/352 all pass. Local static transport timing remains failed (create400ms vs398ms); immutable original independently fails get419vs362/create440vs398. No threshold waived: exact-head hosted static/coverage, analyzer provenance and fresh bot review remain required before merge."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-27T16:49:24.353Z","harness:codex","A zero npm audit result did not prove the complete dependency graph safe: the independent all-package OSV feed detected this advisory. Keep both feeds and exact input hashes, include development and optional versions, and distinguish an affected library from demonstrated production exploitability."
